; Return the machine to its home corner.
; Z lifts fully first (machine Z0 is the top of travel), then X/Y move.
; G53 = machine coordinates, so work offsets (G54 etc.) are ignored.
;
; Called by the PARK user button, and appended to the end of every job by
; custom_filter.py.
o<park> sub
G53 G0 Z0
G53 G0 X0 Y0
o<park> endsub
